### Endpoint: Listar todos los clientes
GET http://localhost/CampoDeportivoRosas/back/ms-reservas/public/index.php/view/clientes

### Endpoint: Crear un nuevo cliente (Escuela de Formacion)
POST http://localhost/CampoDeportivoRosas/back/ms-reservas/public/index.php/view/createcliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Liga Juvenil Boyacá",
  "telefono": "3154443322",
  "tipo": "ESCUELA_FORMACION",
  "correo": "liga@boyaca.example"
}

### Endpoint: Crear un nuevo cliente (Campeonato)
POST http://localhost/CampoDeportivoRosas/back/ms-reservas/public/index.php/view/createcliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Torneo Senior Master",
  "telefono": "3109988776",
  "tipo": "CAMPEONATO",
  "correo": "torneo@senior.example"
}

### Endpoint: Validar recurrencia (Detecta dias no permitidos y cruces)
POST http://localhost/CampoDeportivoRosas/back/ms-reservas/public/index.php/view/validarrecurrencia
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "espacio_id": 1,
  "tipo": "ESCUELA_FORMACION",
  "sesiones": [
    {
      "fecha": "2026-10-21",
      "hora_inicio": "16:00:00",
      "hora_fin": "18:00:00"
    },
    {
      "fecha": "2026-10-25",
      "hora_inicio": "16:00:00",
      "hora_fin": "18:00:00"
    }
  ]
}

### Endpoint: Confirmar reserva - Exito (Campeonato en fin de semana)
POST http://localhost/CampoDeportivoRosas/back/ms-reservas/public/index.php/view/confirmarreserva
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "espacio_id": 1,
  "cliente_id": 2,
  "tipo": "CAMPEONATO",
  "entidad_organizadora": "Torneo Senior Master",
  "fecha": "2026-10-25",
  "hora_inicio": "08:00:00",
  "hora_fin": "12:00:00",
  "anticipo": 150000.00
}

### Endpoint: Confirmar reserva - Error por cruce de horario (409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost/CampoDeportivoRosas/back/ms-reservas/public/index.php/view/confirmarreserva
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "espacio_id": 1,
  "cliente_id": 2,
  "tipo": "CAMPEONATO",
  "entidad_organizadora": "Torneo Secundario",
  "fecha": "2026-10-25",
  "hora_inicio": "10:00:00",
  "hora_fin": "11:00:00",
  "anticipo": 0.00
}

### Endpoint: Confirmar reserva - Error por dia no permitido (Particular entre semana)
POST http://localhost/CampoDeportivoRosas/back/ms-reservas/public/index.php/view/confirmarreserva
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "espacio_id": 1,
  "cliente_id": 3,
  "tipo": "PARTICULAR",
  "entidad_organizadora": "Amigos FC",
  "fecha": "2026-10-21",
  "hora_inicio": "18:00:00",
  "hora_fin": "20:00:00",
  "anticipo": 50000.00
}

### Endpoint: Confirmar reserva - Error cliente inexistente (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost/CampoDeportivoRosas/back/ms-reservas/public/index.php/view/confirmarreserva
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "espacio_id": 1,
  "cliente_id": 9999,
  "tipo": "PARTICULAR",
  "entidad_organizadora": "Sin Registro",
  "fecha": "2026-10-24",
  "hora_inicio": "14:00:00",
  "hora_fin": "16:00:00",
  "anticipo": 0.00
}